156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In this project, we aim to detect faults in mechanical systems with major focus on bearing faults especially those occurring in outer rings. The faults in the bearings were artificially introduced by using EDM\(Electronic Discharge Machine\) in the form of holes of varying diameters. Our methodology involves conducting detailed vibration analysis, applying MCSA and FFT techniques, and utilizing machine learning \(ML\) models to predict faults based on normal and faulty system characteristics.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Through this approach, we aim to develop an intelligent fault detection system that can effectively classify and predict mechanical failures, enabling proactive maintenance and minimizing system failures.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
