169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Detecting faults in mechanical systems, particularly in bearings coupled with shafts, plays a pivotal role in reducing downtime and improving operational efficiency in industrial applications. Various methods have been explored, ranging from traditional vibration-based analysis to more modern approaches utilizing motor current signature analysis \(MCSA\). Advancements in signal processing techniques, coupled with machine learning algorithms, have shown promise in improving fault detection accuracy and reliability.)
/E (Detecting faults in mechanical systems, particularly in bearings coupled with shafts, plays a pivotal role in reducing downtime and improving operational efficiency in industrial applications. Various methods have been explored, ranging from traditional vibration-based analysis to more modern approaches utilizing motor current signature analysis \(MCSA\). Advancements in signal processing techniques, coupled with machine learning algorithms, have shown promise in improving fault detection accuracy and reliability.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
