/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Integrating machine learning with MCSA and vibration analysis enhances fault detection accuracy in our project. By training models like SVMs, Random Forests, and ANNs on features extracted from vibration and stator current signals, we can classify different bearing faults, improving system precision and adaptability to varying conditions. This approach reduces manual inspection and boosts maintenance efficiency.)
/E (Integrating machine learning with MCSA and vibration analysis enhances fault detection accuracy in our project. By training models like SVMs, Random Forests, and ANNs on features extracted from vibration and stator current signals, we can classify different bearing faults, improving system precision and adaptability to varying conditions. This approach reduces manual inspection and boosts maintenance efficiency.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
