/E (In this study, we have collected vibration and motor current signature analysis \(MCSA\) data to detect bearing faults in mechanical systems. The analysis using Fast Fourier Transform \(FFT\) and signal processing techniques has provided critical insights into the frequency-domain characteristics of healthy and faulty bearings. To further enhance the fault detection capabilities, machine learning \(ML\) algorithms such as Decision Trees, Artificial Neural Networks \(ANN\), and Support Vector Machines \(SVM\) have been applied and evaluated for classification accuracy.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
